msgid ""
"Since there are more than 2 Ethernet devices in the system, it is truly a "
"network and to provide interconnectivity an Ethernet Switch is used. It "
"forms the \"heart\" of the system. In this case, it's a small BotBlox switch"
" specifically designed for ArduPilot applications with convenient JST_GH "
"1.25mm connectors:"
msgstr ""
"由于系统中以太网设备超过两台，构成了真正的网络，需要以太网交换机提供互联。它是系统的「核心」。在本例中，使用了一款专为 ArduPilot "
"应用设计的小型 BotBlox 交换机，配备方便的 JST-GH 1.25mm 连接器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:38
