#: c8724698771d49b2bf8547c0a35c814e
msgid ""
"The physical interconnects between the devices is a challenge.  Most device "
"suppliers provide some way to cable out the Ethernet from their device. "
"Unfortunately, this usually involves providing a cable with either a large "
"RJ-45 male or female plug/jack, requiring bulky CAT5 cabling for "
"interconnects. And the device end that uses smaller gauge wires to that "
"RJ-45 termination have non-standarized connectors, sometimes 5 pin, "
"sometimes 4 pin JST-GH."
msgstr ""
"各设备之间的物理互连是一大挑战。大多数设备供应商提供了某种从其设备引出以太网线缆的方式。不幸的是，这通常意味着提供带有大型 RJ-45 "
"公头或母头的线缆，需要使用笨重的 CAT5 线缆进行互连。而设备端连接到该 RJ-45 端头的细线采用非标准化连接器，有时是 5 针，有时是 4 针 "
"JST-GH。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:141
#: 205dd264196f41cd8db725f011b6503f 3626a20afdc942c4b3a40147f80f7ca3
