#: b3a5f0cd34654e0e9c97d4860bba650f
msgid ""
"With the aid of something like this BotBlox adapter which has many of the "
"connector that are used wired in parallel, you can usually rig up a bulky "
"set up on the bench for testing:"
msgstr "借助类似这款 BotBlox 适配器（其将许多常用连接器并联），通常可以在工作台上拼凑出一套笨重的测试设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:148
